          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リモート実行がタイムアウトしました（exec の timeout を増やして再試行）"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "원격 실행 시간 초과(exec에서 timeout을 늘려 재시도)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "远程执行超时（可在 exec 里加大 timeout 参数重试）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "remote_host_guide_linux" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Linux machine's terminal run this one-liner (Debian/Ubuntu; installs the SSH server + registers the key):\nsudo apt install -y openssh-server && sudo systemctl enable --now ssh && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\nThen verify and save with action=connect."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linux のターミナルでこの 1 行を実行（Debian/Ubuntu 系。SSH サーバー導入 + 鍵登録）：\nsudo apt install -y openssh-server && sudo systemctl enable --now ssh && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\nその後 action=connect で検証・保存。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linux 터미널에서 이 한 줄 실행(Debian/Ubuntu 계열. SSH 서버 설치 + 키 등록):\nsudo apt install -y openssh-server && sudo systemctl enable --now ssh && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\n실행 후 action=connect로 검증·저장."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Linux 电脑终端执行这一行（Debian/Ubuntu 系；装 SSH 服务端 + 写入公钥）：\nsudo apt install -y openssh-server && sudo systemctl enable --now ssh && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\n执行后用 action=connect 验证并保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "remote_host_guide_macos" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Mac's Terminal run this one-liner (enables Remote Login + installs the key; will ask for the Mac password):\nsudo systemsetup -setremotelogin on && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\nThen verify and save with action=connect (host=Mac IP, user=Mac username); or run action=discover first (no IP needed)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac のターミナルでこの 1 行を実行（リモートログイン有効化 + 鍵の登録。Mac のパスワードを入力）：\nsudo systemsetup -setremotelogin on && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\nその後 action=connect（host=Mac の IP、user=ユーザー名）で検証・保存。action=discover なら IP 不要で発見できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 터미널에서 이 한 줄 실행(원격 로그인 활성화 + 키 등록. Mac 비밀번호 입력):\nsudo systemsetup -setremotelogin on && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\n실행 후 action=connect(host=Mac IP, user=사용자 이름)로 검증·저장. action=discover로 IP 없이 발견도 가능합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 的「终端」里执行这一行（开启远程登录 + 写入公钥，需输 Mac 密码）：\nsudo systemsetup -setremotelogin on && mkdir -p ~/.ssh && chmod 700 ~/.ssh && echo '%@' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys && chmod 600 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\n执行后用 action=connect（host=Mac 的 IP，user=Mac 用户名）验证并保存；也可以先 action=discover 自动发现（无需 IP）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "remote_host_guide_windows" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Windows \"Admin PowerShell\" run (installs the OpenSSH server + registers the key):\nAdd-WindowsCapability -Online -Name OpenSSH.Server~~~~0.0.1.0; Start-Service sshd; Set-Service sshd -StartupType Automatic; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\" | Out-Null; Add-Content \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\authorized_keys\" '%@'\nThen verify and save with action=connect."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows の「管理者 PowerShell」で実行（OpenSSH サーバー導入 + 鍵登録）：\nAdd-WindowsCapability -Online -Name OpenSSH.Server~~~~0.0.1.0; Start-Service sshd; Set-Service sshd -StartupType Automatic; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\" | Out-Null; Add-Content \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\authorized_keys\" '%@'\nその後 action=connect で検証・保存。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows \"관리자 PowerShell\"에서 실행(OpenSSH 서버 설치 + 키 등록):\nAdd-WindowsCapability -Online -Name OpenSSH.Server~~~~0.0.1.0; Start-Service sshd; Set-Service sshd -StartupType Automatic; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\" | Out-Null; Add-Content \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\authorized_keys\" '%@'\n실행 후 action=connect로 검증·저장."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Windows 的「管理员 PowerShell」执行（装 OpenSSH 服务端 + 写入公钥）：\nAdd-WindowsCapability -Online -Name OpenSSH.Server~~~~0.0.1.0; Start-Service sshd; Set-Service sshd -StartupType Automatic; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\" | Out-Null; Add-Content \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.ssh\\authorized_keys\" '%@'\n执行后用 action=connect 验证并保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
